sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant J as Journal
  participant H as Executor
  participant R as Receiver
  S->>J: commit sending intent
  H->>R: request bytes may leave
  Note over H,J: process terminates before terminal commit
  participant N as New Process
  N->>J: recovery scan
  J-->>N: no terminal outcome
  N->>J: append unknown_outcome
  Note over N: default policy does not resend
